ows it shows that  we made a difference for them  in the short period of time that we were  with them and the experiences that we  can give to them hopefully they'll  remember for  their lifetime so sorry no i i mean what  what do you feel right now out of  curiosity  oh my heart is full it's just happiness  it's wonderful  that was a great surprise thank you  thank you so much it's  all both of you and you guys  are changing so many lives and as a  thank you by the way i started a beauty  company 10 years ago  flower beauty and we are going to send  you a  ton of stuff i'm talking about thousands  of dollars  hair tools and makeup so that  you have that at your disposal and we  also want to send you each  five thousand dollars totaling in ten  just you know a little something to  help aid and foster what you are  doing what you are already doing listen  this money doesn't compare this is our  way of saying thank you to you and  wanting to support and foster  what you are already doing oh thank you  thank you  so much i appreciate you having us thank  you thank you  go to our website to learn all about my  fairy godfathers
 

